                <pb facs="0641" n="507" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg507"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No.
                    292.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">notice.</hi></head>
                <p>Liberated convicts of the fourth category, first section, are informed that in
                    accordance with the commands of a ministerial telegram of August 13, 1887,
                    number 629, permission to depart for the United States of America will be no
                    longer accorded them.</p>
            </div>
